ter understanding the demand, the next step is to explore the roles you can pursue after completing an IoT course in Mumbai.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Job Role<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Responsibilities<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>IoT Developer<\/td><td>Develop applications and systems that connect devices and manage data communication.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Embedded Systems Engineer<\/td><td>Work on hardware and software integration for smart devices using microcontrollers.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>IoT Solutions Engineer<\/td><td>Design and implement IoT-based solutions based on business requirements.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>IoT Support Engineer<\/td><td>Monitor devices, troubleshoot issues, and maintain system performance.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Hardware Engineer<\/td><td>Design and test hardware components used in IoT devices.<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Salary After Completing IoT Course in Mumbai<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>The salary range below helps you understand how earnings in IoT grow as you gain experience, improve your technical skills, and work on real projects:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Experience Level<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Average Annual Salary<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Entry Level (0 &#8211; 1 Years)<\/td><td>\u20b93.5 LPA &#8211; \u20b95.5 LPA<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Mid-Level (4 &#8211; 6 Years)<\/td><td>\u20b96.5 LPA &#8211; \u20b912 LPA<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Senior Level (7+ Years)<\/td><td>\u20b912 LPA &#8211; \u20b920+ LPA<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Top Companies Hiring IoT Engineers in Mumbai<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>In Mumbai, companies across manufacturing, telecom, and technology sectors are hiring IoT engineers to build and manage connected systems. Organizations such as Siemens, Bosch, Honeywell, Schneider Electric, Cisco, and HCL Technologies offer good opportunities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Become an IoT Engineer in Mumbai<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>If you want to build a career as an IoT engineer in Mumbai, you need to develop a mix of hardware, software, and networking skills through a structured approach.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Understand Basic Electronics and Hardware:<\/strong> Start with basic concepts like circuits, sensors, and microcontrollers, as IoT systems depend on hardware components.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Learn Programming Skills:<\/strong> Focus on languages like <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/c-programming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">C<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/cpp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">C++<\/a>, or Python, which are commonly used to control devices and process data.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Study Embedded Systems:<\/strong> Understand how embedded systems work, including how software interacts with hardware in smart devices.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Learn Networking Concepts:<\/strong> Gain knowledge of communication protocols and how devices connect and exchange data over networks.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Work with IoT Platforms and Tools:<\/strong> Practice using platforms that help you build and manage IoT systems and connected devices.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Build Real IoT Projects:<\/strong> Create small projects like home automation or monitoring systems to apply your learning practically.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Join an IoT Course in Mumbai:<\/strong> Enroll in a course that offers hands-on training, projects, and guidance from experienced trainers.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Create a Portfolio:<\/strong> Showcase your projects and practical work to demonstrate your skills to employers.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Apply for Internships and Entry-Level Roles:<\/strong> Start with junior roles to gain real experience and grow in the IoT field.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-bff20328510447bcbc0e6b681aef5e10\"><strong>Explore Our Roadmap Blogs<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-engineer-roadmap\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Data Engineer Roadmap<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/dsa-roadmap\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DSA Roadmap<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/machine-learning-roadmap\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Machine Learning Roadmap<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-development-roadmap\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Web Development Roadmap<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-learn-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO Roadmap<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-roadmap\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Roadmap<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/bl